# Pure Real-World Catchment Map: H.J. Andrews Experimental Forest (Oregon, USA)
# 20 x 20 km (EPSG:26910, Center E=564000 N=4890000)
# DEM: USGS 3DEP 1.0m OR_McKenzieRiver_2021_B21 | Imagery: NAIP 0.60m (2024)
# Adaptive Quadtree LOD 0..8 (0.610 m/px full 20x20km + 0.305 m/px Lookout Creek core)
# Keys: Wheel=Zoom (adaptive LOD streaming), Right-Drag=Orbit, Middle-Drag=Pan, K=Cycle Contours (0/1/2), Home=Reset View
mode 3d
tab 0
draw 0
ground off
gimbal 1
hud 1
plot 0
text 0
terrain examples/demo/maps/hj_andrews_or.epack
contours 1
camera 0 3500 550 0.35 -0.82 0.055 1
